  {
    "data": {
      "id": "labels_cover_reality",
      "mode": "fiat",
      "namespace": "approval",
      "description": "The three labels approve / decline / cannot-take-responsibility express, without excess or gaps, the judgement states an approver can take:\n\n  - **approve**: take it on (optionally reserved with an approver-side `until:<phase>`)\n  - **decline**: refuse; a veto, with a reason comment required\n  - **cannot-take-responsibility**: cannot take this on personally; a delegate may be named",
      "tags": [],
      "root": false
    }
  },
  {
    "data": {
